    # spherical/ellipsoidal: k0 = k_user * cos(lat_ts)/sqrt(1-es sin^2(lat_ts))? For polar etc PROJ uses specific.
    # We'll keep user k0; if lat_ts present and lat0 is pole, PROJ sets scale at lat_ts.
    # This is refined after testing.
    validate_k(ctx)
